        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title game-card-title">Tower of Hanoi</h5>
          <p class="card-text">Solve the classic Tower of Hanoi puzzle using recursive, iterative, and Frame-Stewart approaches.</p>
          <a href="/tower-of-hanoi" class="btn btn-game">Solve Puzzle</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
      <div class="card game-card">
        <img src="/images/queens.svg" class="card-img-top game-card-img" alt="Eight Queens">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title game-card-title">Eight Queens</h5>
          <p class="card-text">Place eight queens on a chessboard without any queen threatening another using sequential and threaded approaches.</p>
          <a href="/eight-queens" class="btn btn-game">Solve Puzzle</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
      <div class="card game-card">
        <img src="/images/knight.svg" class="card-img-top game-card-img" alt="Knight's Tour">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title game-card-title">Knight's Tour</h5>
          <p class="card-text">Move a knight to visit every square on a chessboard exactly once using backtracking and Warnsdorff's rule.</p>
          <a href="/knights-tour" class="btn btn-game">Solve Puzzle</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
      <div class="card game-card">
        <img src="/images/stats.svg" class="card-img-top game-card-img" alt="Statistics">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title game-card-title">Performance Statistics</h5>
